  "summary": {
    "pt": [
      "O Rei de Copas fala de equilíbrio emocional, responsabilidade e maturidade.",
      "Ele representa os sentimentos que sustentam sem afundar.",
      "O foco dele é: entender os próprios desejos e expressá-los."
    ],
    "en": [
      "The King of Cups speaks of emotional balance, responsibility and maturity.",
      "He stands for feelings that hold you up without sinking you.",
      "His focus: understanding his own longings and voicing them."
    ]
  },
